SCOPE AND EXCLUSIONS
--------------------
Licenses apply only to material the licensor has authority to license and
only to rights protected by applicable law. No assertion is made that every
AI-assisted or AI-generated element is copyright-protected or exclusively
owned by the licensor. Existing third-party works, outside scientific
publications, software dependencies, and externally authored audit materials
are NOT relicensed merely by being referenced or archived here. The historical
v1.03 recovery ZIP and older ZIPs must retain their existing provenance
records and applicable notices. See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

No trademark rights, patent rights (beyond what any license itself expressly
grants), moral rights, rights of privacy or rights of publicity are conveyed
beyond the terms and extent of the selected license and governing law.

This file is a scope guide, not a replacement for the authoritative license
texts. Users should read the CC BY 4.0 legal code and MIT text.
